    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5wnmkxt",
      "content": "Electrical components are devices used in electrical circuits to control, protect, or utilize electrical energy. In technical trades such as electrician, electronics technician, and maintenance work, understanding these components and circuit arrangements is essential for installation, repair, and troubleshooting."
    },
