      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. Electrical Circuit"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "In a parallel combination, the equivalent resistance is always less than the individual resistance of any single resistor in the circuit.",
      "id": "vxmewz2"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lng9v8b",
      "content": "An electrical circuit is a closed conducting path through which electric current flows from a power source through various components and returns to the source."
    },
